</c><00:00:01.372><c>furthermore </c><00:00:01.374><c>the  </c><00:00:01.376><c>Bell </c><00:00:01.378><c>is </c><00:00:01.380><c>stretched </c><00:00:01.382><c>in </c><00:00:01.384><c>the </c><00:00:01.386><c>x </c><00:00:01.388><c>and </c><00:00:01.390><c>y  </c><00:00:01.392><c>directions </c><00:00:01.394><c>by </c><00:00:01.396><c>an </c><00:00:01.398><c>amount </c><00:00:01.400><c>that </c><00:00:01.402><c>is  </c><00:00:01.404><c>determined </c><00:00:01.406><c>by </c><00:00:01.408><c>the </c><00:00:01.410><c>variances </c><00:00:01.412><c>of </c><00:00:01.414><c>x </c><00:00:01.416><c>and </c><00:00:01.418><c>y  </c><00:00:01.420><c>however </c><00:00:01.422><c>the </c><00:00:01.424><c>stretching </c><00:00:01.426><c>is </c><00:00:01.428><c>always </c><00:00:01.430><c>along  </c><00:00:01.432><c>the </c><00:00:01.434><c>coordinate </c><00:00:01.436><c>axis </c><00:00:01.438><c>if </c><00:00:01.440><c>you </c><00:00:01.442><c>wanted </c><00:00:01.444><c>a </c><00:00:01.446><c>bell  </c><00:00:01.448><c>that </c><00:00:01.450><c>stretches </c><00:00:01.452><c>in </c><00:00:01.454><c>some </c><00:00:01.456><c>diagonal  </c><00:00:01.458><c>direction </c><00:00:01.460><c>or </c><00:00:01.462><c>if </c><00:00:01.464><c>you </c><00:00:01.466><c>have </c><00:00:01.468><c>contours </c><00:00:01.470><c>that  </c><00:00:01.472><c>are </c><00:00:01.474><c>ellipses </c><00:00:01.476><c>but </c><00:00:01.478><c>with </c><00:00:01.480><c>some </c><00:00:01.482><c>different  </c><00:00:01.484><c>kinds </c><00:00:01.486><c>of </c><00:00:01.488><c>axes </c><00:00:01.490><c>then </c><00:00:01.492><c>you </c><00:00:01.494><c>will </c><00:00:01.496><c>have  </c><00:00:01.498><c>dependence </c><00:00:01.500><c>between </c><00:00:01.502><c>the </c><00:00:01.504><c>two </c><00:00:01.506><c>random  </c><00:00:01.508><c>variables </c><00:00:01.510><c>in </c><00:00:01.512><c>that </c><00:00:01.514><c>case </c><00:00:01.516><c>we </c><00:00:01.518><c>will </c><00:00:01.520><c>be  </c><00:00:01.522><c>dealing </c><00:00:01.524><c>with </c><00:00:01.526><c>a </c><00:00:01.528><c>so-called </c><00:00:01.530><c>bivariate  </c><00:00:01.532><c>normal </c><00:00:01.534><c>distribution </c><00:00:01.536><c>but </c><00:00:01.538><c>we </c><00:00:01.540><c>will </c><00:00:01.542><c>not  </c><00:00:01.544><c>pursue </c><00:00:01.546><c>this </c><00:00:01.548><c>any </c><00:00:01.550><c>further  </c><00:00:01.552><c>at </c><00:00:01.554><c>this </c><00:00:01.556><c>point</c>

